{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01197","headline":"相和歌辞 从军行 · 张祜","name":"相和歌辞 从军行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"少年金紫就光辉，直指边城虎翼飞。\n一卷旌收千骑虏，万全身出百重围。\n黄云断塞寻鹰去，白草连天射雁归。\n白首汉廷刀笔吏，丈夫功业本相依。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张祜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01197.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01197","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}